<title>USA: BankUnited says acquisition approved.</title>
<headline>BankUnited says acquisition approved.</headline>
<dateline>CORAL GABLES, Fla. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>BankUnited Financial Corp said Tuesday its shareholders had approved the acquisition of Suncoast Savings &amp; Loan Association FSA.</p>
<p>The transaction must still be approved by Suncoast shareholders and bank regulators. Suncoast is based in Hollywood, Fla.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to close by the end of November.</p>
<p>Suncoast shareholders are scheduled to meet November12 to consider the deal.  </p>
<p>Under the agreement, one share of BankUnited Class A common will be exchanged for each share of Suncoast common in a tax-free swap.</p>
<p>After the acquisition, BankUnited will have assets of about $1.3 billion and 15 branch offices.</p>
